		)
		(uuid "dc18d985-9cdb-49bf-8591-ef4815f69c8b")
	)
	(text "2  AP63205 BUCK -> D11 ISOLATION -> +5V RAIL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 50 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9b5453c4-d25a-4bed-954a-ccb5c3ef2db3")
	)
	(text "3  XIAO 3V3 OUTPUT / CARRIER LOGIC RAIL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "708d943c-8b2e-4fc8-9086-5468f14bca2f")
	)
	(text "4  SHARED XIAO C3/C6 SOCKETS / UART / LEDS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120 122 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7ef14725-2076-4499-9fe0-db5981d97ebf")
	)
	(text "6  MODULE USB RECOVERY / SHARED-PIN NOTES\nUse the installed module's own BOOT and RESET buttons. No carrier recovery header.\nD9 / BOOT is C3 GPIO9, but C6 GPIO20 (not C6 BOOT). C6 BOOT is not on the side headers.\nR1/R2/R5 retain C3 strap pull-ups. JP1 default 1-2 uses D3; engineering alternate 2-3 uses D9.\nDisconnect the appliance cable before connecting module USB. Choose matching C3/C6 firmware."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 240 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b3c00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006")
	)
	(text "POWER AND OPERATING NOTES\nAppliance pin 1 / pin 3 selection is automatic: U9/U10 TPS259470A eFuses (reverse blocking, UVLO, ILIM) in TI priority power-mux; D18/D20 protect the raw inputs; U11 clamps the data lines.\nU8 AP63205 buck output BUCK_5V reaches the +5V rail through D11, which blocks backfeed into the buck.\nJ5/J6 accept a pre-headered XIAO ESP32-C3 or C6; 3V3 supplies carrier logic only. No battery/underside pads are connected. Native USB remains on the module.\nBoth modules tie header 5V to USB VBUS. D11 protects the buck, not the USB host; no simultaneous-source protection is provided.\nCONNECT ONLY ONE SUPPLY AT A TIME: USB or appliance. Physically disconnect the appliance cable before USB connection.\nU9/U10 TPS259470A: see section 7. DNP = do not populate: test points and mounting holes are not assembled components."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 285 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3fae2a69-e884-47f7-b99a-81e85845110d")
	)
