	(text "7  APPLIANCE INPUT eFUSES / PIN1-PRIORITY POWER MUX (TI TPS259470A, SLVSFC9C Fig. 8-13 Option 2)\nU9 AUXOFF1 (R36 pull-up to +3V3) drives Q1 gate; Q1 source drives U10 OVLO alongside the R45/R37 divider.\nPIN1 below UVLO no longer inhibits PIN3. Both eFuses block reverse current, so their outputs tie to V_INPUT without OR diodes.\nU9 OVLO (R44/R33) locks PIN1 out above ~18.9 V and hands over to PIN3; U10 EN uses a single 360k pull-up per TI note (>=350k)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.20 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d51eea6a-16a7-4f8a-8138-71cac9a1b556")
	)
