	(text "8  DEBUG / REWORK PROVISIONS\nJP2: module GEA3 TX source. Default 1-2 = D6 (UART0 TX, emits ROM boot text at reset). Cut 1-2 and bridge 2-3 to use D4 (C3 GPIO6 / C6 GPIO22, silent at boot; firmware change required).\nTP8/TP9: appliance PIN1/PIN3 after the connector. TP10/TP11: eFuse ILM current monitor (V proportional to channel current).\nIsolated bench: connect one source only. Keep R38 fitted to define U10 EN. FLT pads TP17/18 need an external pull-up for measurement. dV/dt and ITIMER use defaults."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335.28 365.76 0)
		(effects
