	(text "9  REV3E ADDITIONS\nQ1/R45/R37: PIN3 overvoltage lockout, TI SLVSFC9C Fig. 8-13 (Option 2). U10 OVLO has its own 1M/68k divider (18.85 V rising, same as PIN1).\nQ1 (source follower, gate AUXOFF1 at 3.3 V via R36) lifts U10 OVLO to ~1.85-2.65 V while PIN1 is the active source, so PIN1 keeps priority.\nWith U9 unpowered AUXOFF1 sits at <=1.0 V (VPGD), so Q1 can lift OVLO to at most ~0.6 V, below the 1.18 V threshold: verify PIN3-only startup on the isolated fixture.\nU11 SRV05-4: ESD steering array on the three bus lines (J1 pins 4/5/7), clamped to +5V/GND; replaces BAV99 D1-D3.\nTP12: buck output before D11. JP3: normally closed post-D11 service link. Cut only on a disconnected board. Common ground remains. C30: optional bulk capacitor (DNP)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 459.74 203.20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bdbd7c6e-0335-46c2-95c3-ad8c200ea281")
	)
